{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13531","headline":"野外行 · 于逖","name":"野外行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老病无乐事，岁秋悲更长。\n穷郊日萧索，生意已苍黄。\n小弟发亦白，两男俱不强。\n有才且未达，况我非贤良。\n幸以朽钝姿，野外老风霜。\n寒鸦噪晚景，乔木思故乡。\n魏人宅蓬池，结网伫鱣鲂。\n水清鱼不来，岁暮空旁徨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}